<title>LATVIA: RIETUMU BANK WORKS ON REP NETWORK IN CIS.</title>
<headline>RIETUMU BANK WORKS ON REP NETWORK IN CIS.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rietumu Bank, Latvia's fourth largest bank, said on Friday that it will seek approval from the central bank to open rep offices in Kiev, Minsk and St.Petersburg.</p>
<p>&quot;Following the permission granted to open offices in Moscow, Dnepropetrovsk and the capital of Kazakhstan Alma Ata, we will seek an ok for opening another three in Kiev, Minsk and St.Petersburg,&quot; a Rietumu Bank spokesman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
